      or you don''t meet the requirements of the server
      (e.g. connection to Steam).

      For possible time bans - the game author
      is <u>not</u> responsible.

      </size>'
    msg_pl: "<size=80>ZOSTA\u0141E\u015A WYRZUCONY</size>\nSerwer wymusi\u0142 przerwanie
